      en: ["Hosts Qurnat as Sawda, the highest peak in Lebanon at 3,088 m.", "Snow remains on the peaks from November until late June.", "Part of the northern section of the Mount Lebanon range.", "The 'Cedars of God' forest is located on its western slopes.", "Primary water source for the Qadisha and Abou Ali rivers.", "Geologically composed of limestone from the Cretaceous and Jurassic periods."],
