      en: ["The ancient Phoenician Sea Wall is approximately 225 meters long.", "Batroun is mentioned in the 14th-century BC Amarna letters.", "Home to the Saint Stephen’s Cathedral, a blend of Byzantine and Gothic styles.", "Known as 'Botrys' during the Hellenistic and Roman periods.", "Famous for its unique tradition of freshly made lemonade.", "Features some of the most pristine pebble beaches along the Mediterranean."],
